# Blackout: U2 reads CE_N stuck at 1: the ROM never answers, so the CPU never reads the program: it
# runs whatever the open bus and the RAM's random power-on contents give it. Mostly it never writes
# the LEDs; on some power-ons it stumbles on a write to $8000-$9FFF and freezes a random pattern
# there. ROM_N itself is right.
machine led_computer
title "Blackout"
brief "No light runs: the LEDs stay dark, or now and then a few light up at once and stay lit."
fault stuck U2.CE_N 1
